2026-07-27T08:56:06.4155814Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:56:06.4156491Z i /tmp/RtmpjnRgBH/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:56:06.4156935Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:56:06.4157446Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:56:06.4158297Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:56:06.4159008Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:56:06.4160087Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:56:06.4160833Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
